Short:        ARexx Macros to use Indent with GoldED
Author:       dito
Uploader:     bauermichael student uni-tuebingen de
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

Includes in this archive are two small ARexx macros to indent C sources
without leaving GoldED. You'll have to get the Indent1_9_1.lha archive
or something similar to work with it.

